## Code Example

```javascript
async function verifyClaim(msg, lang){
  const q = encodeClaim(msg, lang);
  const docs = await retriever.retrieve(q);
  const res = verifier.score(docs, msg);
  return {score: res.score, justification: res.justification};
}
```

